103
00:04:46,05 --> 00:04:48,05
The main reasons for choosing useReducer

104
00:04:48,05 --> 00:04:50,09
over useStates are multiple.

105
00:04:50,09 --> 00:04:53,05
useReducer gives more control to manage the states

106
00:04:53,05 --> 00:04:56,09
and allows more flexibility to handle complex state shape.

107
00:04:56,09 --> 00:04:58,08
It allows to separate the business logic

108
00:04:58,08 --> 00:05:00,04
from the presentation.

109
00:05:00,04 --> 00:05:02,05
And so state management is more maintainable

110
00:05:02,05 --> 00:05:04,08
in one separate location.

111
00:05:04,08 --> 00:05:06,07
In this video, we conclude the topic

112
00:05:06,07 --> 00:05:08,07
of state management with the hooks.

113
00:05:08,07 --> 00:05:09,09
The things to keep in mind

114
00:05:09,09 --> 00:05:11,04
is that the hooks are a simple way

115
00:05:11,04 --> 00:05:13,08
to manage the state in a React project.

116
00:05:13,08 --> 00:05:16,01
They make it easier than ever to create clean,

117
00:05:16,01 --> 00:05:18,03
maintainable, and reusable code.

118
00:05:18,03 --> 00:05:20,04
There is one common mistake you may face though,

119
00:05:20,04 --> 00:05:22,03
which is to keep the state in one place

120
00:05:22,03 --> 00:05:25,05
and at the top level of the application tree.

121
00:05:25,05 --> 00:05:27,06
Here the logic is handled and accessible

122
00:05:27,06 --> 00:05:30,08
from one single location only, line 43.

123
00:05:30,08 --> 00:05:33,04
And so to pass data down to child components,

124
00:05:33,04 --> 00:05:36,06
like right here, so when you need to pass data to the form

125
00:05:36,06 --> 00:05:40,02
and the result components, we need to pass them manually

126
00:05:40,02 --> 00:05:42,06
as props through every level of the app.

127
00:05:42,06 --> 00:05:44,04
This is one recurrent issue,

128
00:05:44,04 --> 00:05:46,06
commonly known as props drilling,

129
00:05:46,06 --> 00:05:48,03
when you have to manually pass data

130
00:05:48,03 --> 00:05:51,04
through every component from the top level to the bottom.

131
00:05:51,04 --> 00:05:53,00
And so the bigger the application,

132
00:05:53,00 --> 00:05:56,03
the more complex it becomes to maintain in the long run.

133
00:05:56,03 --> 00:05:57,05
The best solution is to keep

134
00:05:57,05 --> 00:05:59,07
the state management structure flat.

